This project includes code derived from the Herdr desktop app
(https://github.com/herdrdev/herdr-app), licensed under the Apache License,
Version 2.0. Changed files:

- src/classic/main.js: modified from Herdr's built-in "agents" mod
  (herdr-app 0.1.15). Changes: agents shown as team players with jerseys,
  shirt numbers and keeper kits; working, blocked and done states drawn as
  football animations and words; team colors and list title from team.js.
- src/classic/layout.json: Herdr's "main" layout (herdr-app 0.1.15), with the
  agents block pointed at the team's agents mod and the team theme set by
  build.py.

The generated copies of these files in each team folder
(*/mods/*-agents/main.js and */layouts/<CODE>.json) carry the same changes.

The stadium layout's three-band design (field, rail, terminals below) is
inspired by the "pasture" example in https://github.com/herdrdev/herdr-layout-examples
(Apache License, Version 2.0). Its code is original to this project.

